uest_authorization c2 -> a2 authorized_value 4873\nNow next commit c2 a2 value 4873. Yes.\n\nNeed output exactly JSON. Ensure no markdown.\n\nPotential issue: Do we need to include \"arguments_json\" as JSON string, not object. Yes.\n\nNeed maybe use \"committed_value\":4873 as number. In JSON-encoded string, it's 4873. Good.\n\nLet's final.","signature":"36efc03d-06ec-404e-be1d-c4b6bedd891c"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"commit\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"authorization_id\\\":\\\"a2\\\",\\\"candidate_id\\\":\\\"c2\\\",\\\"committed_value\\\":4873,\\\"idempotency_key\\\":\\\"idem-P2F-FORMAL-V-009-c2-a2\\\"}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":711,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":2944,"output_tokens":1034,"service_tier":"standard"}}